40:29.584 --> 40:33.134
I give a little, maybe a little sneak peek at some things coming up in

40:33.634 --> 40:36.024
the future. So if you want to be on the in, you should go to

40:36.524 --> 40:39.783
that. And I'll just add one thing. I noticed on the Eagle Mountain Citizens page,

40:39.799 --> 40:43.622
you'll jump in When people start bagging on stuff they don't know anything about,

40:44.136 --> 40:47.349
