41:07.606 --> 41:10.306
see? Well,

41:11.270 --> 41:15.046
what about like a heat island or something? I research it to the fullest extent.

41:15.142 --> 41:18.485
I want to know where it came from, what's the rebuttal argument about it,

41:18.581 --> 41:21.473
and then how does that affect us out here? You know, I heard a lot

41:21.973 --> 41:24.559
about, you know, air pollutants. We want to preserve that. I work a lot with

41:25.059 --> 41:28.801
Miriam with the wildlife preservation, and it's just— it's

41:29.301 --> 41:32.095
been a lot going through that. And so I do want to make sure that

41:32.595 --> 41:34.055
I help people out. My phone number is on the ballot. Thank you. out there,

41:34.183 --> 41:37.025
anybody, I always put that in, you know, the Facebook, like, call me, I'm here

41:37.475 --> 41:40.767
night or day, the weekend, I don't care. I'm single, I don't have a life.

41:40.911 --> 41:44.187
So just call me and we can talk about it. I'll take you out,

41:44.203 --> 41:46.627
I'll drive you by the data centers, I'll drive you by wherever you want to

41:47.127 --> 41:50.079
