45:01.624 --> 45:04.817
expert here at our city, and and that person in the code would be called

45:04.914 --> 45:07.129
our water rights analyst. It's code.

45:07.928 --> 45:11.802
Helps to establish when water rights would be dedicated

45:11.866 --> 45:12.493
