45:14.614 --> 45:18.319
Water rights, what the proposal is, is that residential water

45:18.819 --> 45:22.677
would be dedicated at the time of, if someone's

45:23.177 --> 45:27.574
going through the master development plan process,

45:27.590 --> 45:32.218
