45:32.797 --> 45:36.811
if there's other uses, it would be dedicated at the

45:37.311 --> 45:38.106
time of building permit.

45:41.840 --> 45:44.178
A couple of other things that we've tried to address in this,

45:45.708 --> 45:48.920
and this is kind of part of a bigger process of trying to get in

45:49.420 --> 45:52.971
front of development and make sure we have proper

45:53.019 --> 45:57.407
