46:07.391 --> 46:09.257
the purpose of that will-serve letter is one,

46:11.549 --> 46:15.438
for the city to say, yep, we can, you know,

46:15.583 --> 46:19.687
you developer have shown us that you have water.

46:20.675 --> 46:25.061
And number 2, there's sufficient infrastructure in

