02:52:37.537 --> 02:52:41.053
I am grateful, I am gifted, and I have something to give. And she made

02:52:41.150 --> 02:52:45.935
all of us say it. And she went on to say that she

02:52:45.967 --> 02:52:50.207
wants us to be grateful because all of us ran for this position

02:52:50.400 --> 02:52:53.099
or applied for the job that we have,

02:52:53.356 --> 02:52:56.715
