02:53:15.323 --> 02:53:17.699
everything that's going on in the world, what would happen if we all just leaned

02:53:18.199 --> 02:53:21.827
into the fact that everyone has different gifts and everyone brings

02:53:22.327 --> 02:53:26.019
something unique to our communities and to

02:53:26.052 --> 02:53:29.585
their roles here at the city? And I just thought that was such

02:53:30.085 --> 02:53:34.019
