02:57:55.341 --> 02:57:58.820
the widening project. And so that's the nature of the agreement. It does

02:57:58.916 --> 02:58:02.875
also require us to pay for certain construction-related costs

02:58:03.725 --> 02:58:06.851
related to like relocating cart paths and things like that,

02:58:07.187 --> 02:58:10.697
golf course infrastructure that's being disrupted by the the, the purchase

02:58:11.197 --> 02:58:14.880
of this land. So that's kind of the nature of the agreement.

02:58:16.162 --> 02:58:19.623
