03:41:02.292 --> 03:41:05.274
But what I really should say is I don't really work anymore. I just work

03:41:05.774 --> 03:41:09.730
in my city council job. That's— last week I spent— I, I was

03:41:10.230 --> 03:41:13.065
at my office on Monday until noon, and the rest of the week I was

03:41:13.113 --> 03:41:16.207
gone out with city stuff. It's busy,

03:41:16.560 --> 03:41:20.532
busy, busy. Well, If there's no other items,

03:41:21.373 --> 03:41:25.565
then I'll open— we do have some more closed session items, so I would request

03:41:26.065 --> 03:41:29.374
that we take about a 5-minute break. We'll get set up and then we'll

03:41:29.874 --> 03:41:33.546
go do that. I move to adjourn to a closed

03:41:34.046 --> 03:41:38.087
session. Let's see, for the purpose of

03:41:38.103 --> 03:41:41.685
discussion pending or reasonably imminent litigation, the character,

03:41:41.734 --> 03:41:45.299
professional competence, or physical or mental health of an individual, the purchase, lease, sell,

03:41:45.315 --> 03:41:49.098
or exchange of real property, a proposed development agreement, project proposal,

03:41:49.114 --> 03:41:52.560
or financing proposal related to the development of land owned

03:41:53.060 --> 03:41:56.863
by the state or political subdivision, and/or the deployment of security personnel,

03:41:56.928 --> 03:41:59.571
devices, or systems pursuant to Section 52-4-205,

03:42:03.430 --> 03:42:06.336
Section 1 of the Utah Code Annotated. Second.

03:42:06.950 --> 03:42:09.905
Okay, we have a motion by Councilmember Wright and a second by Councilmember Clark.

03:42:10.908 --> 03:42:13.891
And we'll start the voting with Councilmember Wright. Yes.

03:42:14.116 --> 03:42:16.396
Councilmember Clark. Yes. Councilmember Hewish.

03:42:17.006 --> 03:42:19.366
Yes. Councilmember Whiting. Yes.

03:42:19.976 --> 03:42:23.172
Okay, at 8:16 we'll go to closed session, and when we're done we'll come back

03:42:23.188 --> 03:42:25.484
here for adjournment.

03:43:34.792 --> 03:43:38.418
All right, it is 10:27 and we are back in our

03:43:38.722 --> 03:43:41.578
council meeting, and I'm entertaining a motion.

03:43:42.251 --> 03:43:44.978
Motion to adjourn. Second.

03:43:45.604 --> 03:43:48.716
A motion by Council Member Wright and a second by Council Member Hewish. All in

03:43:48.812 --> 03:43:51.764
favor? Aye. Any opposed? Seeing none,

03:43:51.956 --> 03:43:54.956
we are adjourned at 10:27. Thank you.
